-- Tests for Chuong VII: the same question is asked of each vintage wherever the vintages differ. V1 is pinned
-- at 1 June 2025, V2 at 1 March 2026, V3 at 1 August 2026. The day D in the question is a separate input.

§ `Tests: Chuong VII`

