§§ `Dieu 157`

-- src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:539 | 1. Các hợp đồng bảo hiểm đã giao kết trước ngày Luật này có hiệu lực và còn
-- src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:540 | thời hạn hợp đồng thì tiếp tục thực hiện theo quy định của pháp luật tại thời điểm
-- src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:541 | giao kết hợp đồng bảo hiểm, trừ trường hợp các bên tham gia hợp đồng bảo hiểm
-- src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:542 | có thỏa thuận về việc sửa đổi, bổ sung hợp đồng để phù hợp với Luật này và để áp
-- src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:543 | dụng quy định của Luật này.
@ref Dieu 157 (src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:539-543)
`a running contract made in 2022` MEANS `A contract made before the commencement` WITH
    `date the contract was made` IS YMD 2022 6 1
    `the contract is still running on 1 January 2023` IS TRUE
    `the parties agreed to amend it to conform to this Law and to apply this Law` IS FALSE
`a running contract made in 2022 and amended to conform` MEANS `A contract made before the commencement` WITH
    `date the contract was made` IS YMD 2022 6 1
    `the contract is still running on 1 January 2023` IS TRUE
    `the parties agreed to amend it to conform to this Law and to apply this Law` IS TRUE
`a contract made on the commencement day` MEANS `A contract made before the commencement` WITH
    `date the contract was made` IS YMD 2023 1 1
    `the contract is still running on 1 January 2023` IS TRUE
    `the parties agreed to amend it to conform to this Law and to apply this Law` IS FALSE
`a contract made in 2022 that has ended` MEANS `A contract made before the commencement` WITH
    `date the contract was made` IS YMD 2022 6 1
    `the contract is still running on 1 January 2023` IS FALSE
    `the parties agreed to amend it to conform to this Law and to apply this Law` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `Dieu 157(1): the text that governs the contract` `a running contract made in 2022` EQUALS `the law in force when the contract was made`
#ASSERT `Dieu 157(1): the text that governs the contract` `a running contract made in 2022 and amended to conform` EQUALS `Law 08/2022/QH15`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 157(1): the text that governs the contract` `a contract made on the commencement day`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 157(1): the text that governs the contract` `a contract made in 2022 that has ended`
